        "descriptionModule": {
          "briefSummary": "This study is to determine whether efalizumab 1.0mg/kg given by subcutaneous injection for 12 weeks is effective in treating oral lichen planus.\n\nThis is a 20 week, single center, open-label pilot study to enroll 5 subjects."
