          "briefTitle": "CArotenoid in hypoChOlesterolemia",
          "officialTitle": "Characterization of the Density of Macular Pigment in Patients With Primary Intestinal Hypocholesterolemia and Its Relation to Their Carotenoid and Anti-oxidant Status.",
          "acronym": "CaCo"
        },
