          "officialTitle": "Phase 1 Pharmacokinetic (PK) and Pharmacodynamic (PD) Study of the Combination of Cetuximab (C-225), a Chimeric Monoclonal Antibody Against the Epidermal Growth Factor Receptor (EGFR), and Gefitinib (ZD1839), a Selective EGFR Tyrosine Kinase Inhibitor, in Patients With Advanced Cancer"
