}"}], "tool_call_id": "call_n9ja5iof"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Here are the three lung cancer treatment studies that started closest to the month before the ESMO Virtual Congress 2020, with their titles translated into Spanish:

1. **"Telaglenastat Hydrochloride and Osimertinib in Treating Patients With EGFR-Mutated Stage IV Non-small Cell Lung Cancer"**
   - **Spanish Title:** "Telaglenastato clorhidrato e osimertinib en el tratamiento de pacientes con cáncer de pulmón no pequeño de etapa IV mutado en EGFR"
   - Start Date: March 16, 2020

2. **"A Study of DR-0202 in Patients With Locally Advanced or Metastatic, Relapsed or Refractory Carcinomas"**
   - **Spanish Title:** "Estudio de DR-0202 en pacientes con carcinomas localmente avanzados o metastásicos, recurrentes o refractarios"
   - Start Date: June 3, 2025

3. **"An Open-Label Phase 1/2 Study of Itacitinib in Combination With Osimertinib in Subjects With Non-Small Cell Lung Cancer"**
   - **Spanish Title:** "Estudio de fase 1/2 abierto con itacitina en combinación con osimertinib en sujetos con cáncer de pulmón no pequeño"
   - Start Date: December 20, 2016

These studies are listed in order of their start dates closest to the specified timeframe."}]

