          "briefTitle": "The Cogni-Action Project: Physical Activity, Brain, and Cognition",
          "officialTitle": "Rationale, Design and Methods of a Study on Physical Activity, Sedentarism, Physical Fitness, and Brain , Cognitive Performance and Academic Achievement in School Children. The Cogni-Action Project",
          "acronym": "Cogni-Action"
        },
        "statusModule": {
